# CRO & Lead Generation Engineering Guidelines

To maximize lead conversions for Welcome Consultancy's DGFT & EXIM advisory services:

## 1. High-Converting Visual Architecture
- Corporate color scheme: **Deep Navy (`#0F172A`) & Warm Gold (`#D4AF37`)**.
- Hero sections must feature clear value propositions, trust badges (10+ Years, 500+ Exporters), and prominent dual CTAs ("Calculate Incentives" / "Book Free Consultation").
- Verified client testimonials (C.D. Shah, Yusuf Tai, etc.) displayed prominently.

## 2. Interactive Lead Magnets & EXIM Calculators
Implement high-converting client tools:
- **RoDTEP & Duty Drawback Export Incentive Calculator**: Inputs FOB Turnover & Sector -> Estimates cashback/incentive recovery.
- **EPCG Duty Savings Estimator**: Inputs Capital Goods Value -> Displays instant duty savings & export obligation timeline.
- **Custom EXIM Document Checklist Generator**: Exports downloadable custom document checklists based on product category.

## 3. Consultation Booking Calendar (Slot Scheduler)
- Interactive calendar allowing prospective exporters to select available date and time slots.
- Real-time synchronization with Admin CMS availability settings.
- Captures client name, mobile number, company name, service interest, and chosen slot.

## 4. Sticky Contact CTAs & Lead Forms
- **Sticky WhatsApp Bubble**: Direct link to `+91 98671 73397` with pre-filled message ("Hello Welcome Consultancy, I need EXIM advisory for...").
- **Sticky Phone Call Trigger**: Fast one-tap calling on mobile viewports.
- **Exit-Intent / Quick Consultation Popup Modal**: Non-intrusive popup for high-intent visitors.
- **Service Inquiry Forms**: Every service page must feature a quick inquiry widget capturing the user's mobile number, email, and specific service requirement.
